<title>USA: Welland Canal cargo, vessel fees to rise in 1998.</title>
<headline>Welland Canal cargo, vessel fees to rise in 1998.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo toll fees and vessel charge per Gross Registered Ton will increase in 1998 along the Welland Canal section of the St. Lawrence Seaway, officials of U.S. and Canadian seaway agencies said Thursday.</p>
<p>The U.S. Saint Lawrence Seaway Development Corporation and the Canadian Seaway Authority said that cargo toll fees will increase by 2.5 percent at the beginning of the 1998 navigation season.</p>
<p>While vessel charges will also increase, lockage charges will be eliminated, the agencies said.</p>
</text>
